WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.280
FutureProof Terrain is a modular wargaming terrain system from Snot Goblin Gaming.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:08.560
Umair designed the Kickstarter campaign presentation around its practical uses, working with

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.840
the creator's product imagery.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:17.061
The campaign graphic shows an assembled building beside separate walls and floors.

00:00:17.061 --> 00:00:20.872
That relationship matters: a player needs to understand how the pieces become

00:00:20.872 --> 00:00:24.683
terrain they can use on a table.

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:29.001
Short benefit headings keep the graphic easy to scan. The Snot Goblin

00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:32.878
identity and green accents frame the product against a dark background, so

00:00:32.878 --> 00:00:36.754
the terrain still carries the explanation.

00:00:37.154 --> 00:00:41.708
For a modular product, the same logic carries through the campaign: show

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:46.262
the contents, an assembled view and the differences between rewards. This is

00:00:46.262 --> 00:00:50.815
campaign creative from the original 2024 launch. It does not measure advertising

00:00:50.815 --> 00:00:55.369
performance or attribute the campaign's funding.
